\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Gracious Spirit, dwell with me!
\par I myself would gracious be,
\par And with words that help and heal 
\par Would Thy life in mine reveal,
\par And with actions bold and meek
\par Would for Christ my Saviour speak.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Truthful Spirit, dwell with me! 
\par I myself would truthful be,
\par And with wisdom kind and clear
\par Let Thy life in mine appear,
\par And with actions brotherly
\par Speak my Lord's sincerity.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Tender Spirit, dwell with me!
\par I myself would tender be
\par Shut my heart up like a flower
\par At temptation's darksome hour;
\par Open it when shines the sun,
\par And His love by fragrance own.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Mighty Spirit, dwell with me!
\par I myself would mighty be,
\par Mighty so as to prevail
\par Where unaided man must fail,
\par Ever by a mighty hope
\par Pressing on and bearing up.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Holy Spirit, dwell with me!
\par I myself would holy be;
\par Separate from sin, I would
\par Choose and cherish all things good,
\par And, whatever I can be,
\par Give to Him who gave me Thee.
\par \i\tab\tab\tab\i0 
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

